ategories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"V9cFVduC9KVYkSDfJ576yg","review_id":"u13oXsIZzBJASG7z54E5sg","date":"2014-09-29T20:20:20","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9346094131469727,"text_excerpt":"This small dive bar is a good break from the madness of Bourbon Street, and also there are extremely nice people working there. In fact, our bartender actually brought in a crock pot of jambalaya to share with her customers just because the Saints game was on at that time. That is beyond nice. The drinks were good, and the bartender was great at making each drink specifically according to our tastes. The atmosphere was typical of a good dive bar, dark, cheap, laid-back crowd, no attitudes. I'll definitely stop in again when I'm in town."},{"business_id":"V9cFVduC9KVYkSDfJ576yg","review_id":"plBc2dtSfagHMc_FG5e7Tg","date":"2015-11-10T14:18:12","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9316937923431396,"text_excerpt":"If you need to get off Bourbon for a bit and wind down from the craziness, come to Johnny White's. There's beer, mixed drinks, seating, and an upstairs balcony all waiting for you! The bartender working the day we visited was very nice and welcoming. There seemed to be a bunch of regulars stopping by. The prices are decent. It seems kind of divey but not filthy like some other dive bars in the area. Definitely a solid place to check out."},{"business_id":"V9cFVduC9KVYkSDfJ576yg","review_id":"pORHVVmMM3nbPdwivPj93Q","date":"2014-06-22T17:10:34","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9235444068908691,"text_excerpt":"Johnny White's is one of my favorite dives off of Bourbon. It's across the street from Preservation Hall and Pat O's. I love this place because it's what a dive should be... Strong drinks, a great bartender, loud music, a kick ass jukebox, kinda dirty, and a crowd that is there to drink! Cheers y'all!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"V9cFVduC9KVYkSDfJ576yg","photo_id":"ngRWLNF3vhAJNcPn_ogVlw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/ngRWLNF3vhAJNcPn_ogVlw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9534797072410583},{"business_id":"V9cFVduC9KVYkSDfJ576yg","photo_id":"hbiAEYXPRsQqTa-hMu3EWA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/hbiAEYXPRsQqTa-hMu3EWA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9316549301147461},{"business_id":"V9cFVduC9KVYkSDfJ576yg","photo_id":"p56RrxAV8k6UJdI9aUAwUQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/p56RrxAV8k6UJdI9aUAwUQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8855705261230469},{"business_id":"V9cFVduC9KVYkSDfJ576yg","photo_id":"5UZ0reGQEYgSEYrIh9fXIw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/5UZ0reGQEYgSEYrIh9fXIw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7805924415588379}]},"notebook_case":null}
